      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9260516::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC10621632::web::026::simulated_particle_formation_and_influen"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mechanism may fail in solution-based processes with inherently high atomic mobility.",
